onent. A July poll of likely voters showed Ryan ahead 53-39, and prediction markets price his chances around 95 percent.\n\nThe main storyline in the fall has been Republican attacks on Ryan's residency, including an ethics complaint over claims he lives in Washington while representing New York. Ryan has countered with a steady stream of local-focused events and legislation on costs, energy assistance, and veterans' issues. The fundamentals still favor the incumbent by a wide margin.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.983, "margin": 17.1}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.971, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9767, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9844, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9723, "margin": 16.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9684, "margin": 14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.971, "margin": 14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.978, "margin": 14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9814, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9828, "margin": 14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9869, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9867, "margin": 16.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9709, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.972, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9706, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9758, "margin": 16.0}]}